11
00:00:27,298 --> 00:00:29,312
Create the rounded shell, then hollow it

12
00:00:29,312 --> 00:00:31,072
to two point four millimetre walls and

13
00:00:31,072 --> 00:00:31,705
floor.

14
00:00:32,383 --> 00:00:34,931
These dimensions stay editable in the FreeCAD

15
00:00:34,931 --> 00:00:35,649
